@startuml CU-09
actor "Administrador / Gestor de catálogo" as Adm
boundary "«UI» Angular (admin)" as UI
control "«Controller» API /catalog/options" as Ctrl
entity "«Model» CatalogConfigService / Season, Collection" as Model

Adm -> UI : 1: crear temporada
UI -> Ctrl : 2: POST /catalog/options/seasons
Ctrl -> Model : 3: create_season(db, data)
Model --> Ctrl : 4: SeasonRead
Ctrl --> UI : 5: SeasonRead
UI --> Adm : 6: temporada creada

Adm -> UI : 7: crear colección
UI -> Ctrl : 8: POST /catalog/options/collections
Ctrl -> Model : 9: create_collection(db, data)
Model --> Ctrl : 10: CollectionRead
Ctrl --> UI : 11: CollectionRead
UI --> Adm : 12: colección creada

Adm -> UI : 13: editar colección (activar/desactivar)
UI -> Ctrl : 14: PATCH /catalog/options/collections/{id}
Ctrl -> Model : 15: update_collection(db, id, data)
Model --> Ctrl : 16: CollectionRead
Ctrl --> UI : 17: colección actualizada

Adm -> UI : 18: consultar temporadas/colecciones
UI -> Ctrl : 19: GET /catalog/options/seasons | /collections
Ctrl -> Model : 20: list_seasons/list_collections(db)
Model --> Ctrl : 21: list[SeasonRead/CollectionRead]
Ctrl --> UI : 22: temporadas y colecciones mostradas

@enduml